 "titulo": "My train stopped at a station that isn't on the map 😨 Part 1 #horror #shorts",
 "capa": "NOT ON ANY MAP",
 "descripcion": "Nora's last train home takes twenty minutes and six stops. Tonight it ran for forty minutes, then stopped at Harlow.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWould you get off?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "My train stopped at a station that isn't on any map.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I have taken that line home every night for six years.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I'm Nora, twenty-eight, a nurse.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I work nights at the hospital. I know every stop by heart.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Every night, the 11:40 home. Twenty minutes, six stops.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I always sit in the second car, by the door, with a coffee.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Tonight, after forty minutes, we still hadn't stopped.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "Outside the window, no houses, no roads. Just black trees, for miles.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Everyone else in the car was asleep. Everyone.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I shook the man next to me, hard. He was warm and breathing, but he didn't wake.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then the doors opened at a platform called Harlow.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "The speaker said: Harlow. This is your stop, Nora.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "No town. No lights. Just a man, waving me out.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "My sister texted: where are you?",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
